    <CodeSnippet Title="Markers" ClassName=@typeof(MarkersDemo).ToString()>
        <Description>
            <p>
                <code>Markers.Shape</code> takes one shape or a list. One shape, such as <code>Shape = MarkerShape.Square</code>,
                applies to every series. A list assigns shapes by series index: the first shape goes to the first series,
                the second to the second series, and so on. The list does not repeat, so a series without an entry is drawn
                with the default circle. The tooltip and legend markers follow the same shapes.
            </p>
        </Description>
        <Snippet>
            <MarkersDemo />
        </Snippet>
    </CodeSnippet>

